        <item>
            <title>0.1.19</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 16:16:39 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://thisweek.is</link>
            <sparkle:version>0.1.19</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.19</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>ThisWeek Desktop 0.1.19</h2>
<p>Menu bar meeting title no longer sticks after a meeting ends.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Clears the status text when nothing should be shown, so finished meetings don’t linger.</li>
  <li>Always shows the next upcoming meeting in the menu bar (title + time until start).</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
