        <item>
            <title>0.1.18</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 02:40:22 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://thisweek.is</link>
            <sparkle:version>0.1.18</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.18</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>ThisWeek Desktop 0.1.18</h2>
<p>Menu bar shows time remaining while you’re in a meeting.</p>
<ul>
  <li>During an in-progress event, the tick title shows a truncated name and “Xh Ym left”.</li>
  <li>Before a meeting starts, it still shows “in Xm” when it begins within an hour.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
